---

---

<section class="features" id="features">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>One feature. Done right.</h2>
    <p>
      Task decomposition powered by AI that actually understands how ADHD works.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card main-feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>AI-Powered Task Decomposition</h3>
      <p>
        Tell Tiny Steps what you need to do. Our AI breaks it into 5&ndash;15
        micro-steps that start with the smallest possible physical action — like
        "stand up" or "open your laptop." Each step is one action, one verb, zero
        ambiguity.
      </p>
      <div class="feature-example">
        <span class="example-label">Example</span>
        <span class="example-input">"File my taxes" &rarr;</span>
        <span class="example-output">
          "Open your laptop" &rarr; "Go to browser" &rarr; "Type in the tax website URL" &rarr; ...
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14" />
          <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>One Step at a Time</h3>
      <p>
        No overwhelming lists. You see only the current step. Tap "Done" and the
        next one appears. A progress bar tracks how far you've come — not how far
        you have to go.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
          <path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2" />
          <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="9.01" y2="9" />
          <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="15.01" y2="9" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Celebrate Every Win</h3>
      <p>
        Finish your last step and get a full-screen confetti celebration. It's not
        silly — it's dopamine your brain actually needs to build momentum for the
        next task.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 20h9" />
          <path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>ADHD-First Language</h3>
      <p>
        No "just do it." No "simply." Every step uses direct, kind language with
        imperative verbs. Transition steps like "walk to the kitchen" are included
        because your brain needs them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--stone-900);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-header p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--stone-500);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--stone-200);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    border-color: var(--stone-300);
  }

  .feature-card.main-feature {
    grid-column: 1;
    border-color: var(--amber-200);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--amber-50), white 60%);
  }

  .feature-card.main-feature:hover {
    border-color: var(--amber-300);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--amber-50);
    color: var(--amber-600);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--stone-800);
    margin-bottom: 0.625rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--stone-500);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .feature-example {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--amber-100);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .example-label {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.625rem;
    background: var(--amber-100);
    color: var(--amber-700);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .example-input {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--stone-700);
  }

  .example-output {
    color: var(--stone-400);
    font-size: 0.825rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    .feature-card.main-feature {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
